# EAS upload ignore — git repo root
# The RN Android app lives in app/react-native. Everything else in this
# monorepo (Flutter app, Swift SDK, web, hardware, docs, plugins) is huge
# and must NOT be uploaded to EAS. EAS reads .easignore from the project
# root (where eas.json lives) — keep these exclusions here too.
**/node_modules/
node_modules/
web/
omiGlass/
sdks/
omi/
plugins/
docs/
desktop/
hardware/
# Build output / caches
**/android/
**/ios/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/build/
*.log
.env
.DS_Store
